<!--
  Rewritten 2026-08-13 at the V2 cutover.

  It previously listed eight https://www.colaberry.com/ URLs and none of this
  site's own, so search engines were being pointed at a different domain
  entirely. It also listed /case-studies, which carried fabricated customer
  stories and has since been withdrawn and redirected.

  Only pages that exist and are publishable belong here. Retired marketing paths
  (/program, /case-studies, /demo-day, /advisory, /consulting, /about) are
  deliberately absent: they redirect, and listing a redirect target's source in a
  sitemap invites a crawler to index the wrong URL.
-->
